{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach it. Otherwise, scan for it. If close, grab it. Finally, check its properties. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanForObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInReach    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    />\"",
